        "documentation": [
          "(module) src",
          "F1Brainz - Formula 1 Race Prediction System\n\nA comprehensive system for collecting, analyzing, and predicting F1 race results\nusing FastF1 telemetry data and machine learning.\n\nMain modules:\n  - data: Data collection and database management\n  - models: Data models and machine learning models\n  - analysis: Analysis tools for sector times and race performance\n  - utils: Utility functions and configuration\n  - features: Feature engineering for ML models"
        ]
      },
